e: 14pt;">Exchange Application Schedule 2026/27</span></strong></span></p>
<div class="table-responsive"><table style="height: 206px; width: 69.2638%; border-collapse: collapse; border-style: solid; border-color: #cccccc;" border="#cccccc">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 21px;">
<td style="width: 23.4691%; height: 21px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>APPLICATION TIMELINE</strong></span></td>
<td style="width: 23.3279%; height: 21px; text-align: center;">
<p><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt;">FALL</span><br />
</strong><strong>(Semester 1 / Full Year Intake)</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="width: 22.4667%; height: 21px; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt;">SPRING</span><br />
(Semester 2 Intake)</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 21px;">
<td style="width: 23.4691%; height: 21px; text-align: center;"><strong>Application Opening Date</strong></td>
<td style="width: 23.3279%; height: 21px; text-align: center;">April 1, 2026</td>
<td style="width: 22.4667%; height: 21px; text-align: center;">September 1, 2026</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 21px;">
<td style="width: 23.4691%; height: 21px; text-align: center;"><strong>Application Closing Date</strong></td>
<td style="width: 23.3279%; height: 21px; text-align: center;">April 30, 2026</td>
<td style="width: 22.4667%; height: 21px; text-align: center;">September 30, 2026</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 21px;">
<td style="width: 23.4691%; height: 21px; text-align: center;"><strong>Accommodation Application Period </strong></td>
